description: "Orcraft features: orchestration, remote endpoints, logs, results and security."
---

<section class="section container">
  <h1>Features</h1>
  <p class="text-muted">Everything needed to generate, distribute and analyze test execution.</p>

  <div class="grid grid--3">
    <article class="card">
      <span class="card__icon">{% icon "code" %}</span>
      <h3 class="card__title">AI test generation</h3>
      <p class="card__text">Point the generator at your resources and instructions; it scaffolds suites, tests and flows.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <span class="card__icon">{% icon "route" %}</span>
      <h3 class="card__title">Run planning</h3>
      <p class="card__text">Pick groups, tests and cases, set configuration per instance, and preview the plan before launch.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <span class="card__icon">{% icon "terminal-2" %}</span>
      <h3 class="card__title">GUI + CLI + CI</h3>
      <p class="card__text">Drive the same suites from the controller, the command line or a CI pipeline.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <span class="card__icon">{% icon "share-3" %}</span>
      <h3 class="card__title">Remote &amp; shared endpoints</h3>
      <p class="card__text">Reserve machines across the lab, share them between engineers and run in parallel.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <span class="card__icon">{% icon "file-analytics" %}</span>
      <h3 class="card__title">Logs &amp; results</h3>
      <p class="card__text">Live per-case logs, saved sessions, aggregated results and exportable reports.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <span class="card__icon">{% icon "shield-lock" %}</span>
      <h3 class="card__title">Security</h3>
      <p class="card__text">mTLS between controller and endpoints, with token-based access control.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
